    "text": "thenewpolitical.com\nwebsite\nAthens\nCity of Athens website sparks controversy with use of AI\nBy Claire Lovinski,\n11 hours agoOn July 29, the City of Athens’ YouTube account uploaded a 41-second video introducing Benny the Brick, a chatbot designed to answer any and all questions residents might have about Athens. This video, which can also be found on the city’s Instagram page, is the second most viewed video on the platform.",
